.TH ARACNE 1 2000-1月 "edges" "edges"
.SH NAME
edges \- Get the regulation edges of the inferred network as a data frame.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIedges(\fBnet\fR as <generic> AracneNetwork);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the regulation edges of the inferred network as a data frame.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBnet\fB \fR\- the network that is created via the \fBaracne\fR api. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a data frame with the columns: \fBregulator\fR, \fBtarget\fR, \fBmi\fR, \fBcorrelation\fR,
 \fBinteraction\fR, \fBis_tf_source\fR, \fBis_tf_target\fR, \fBprior\fR and \fBregulation\fR.
 The rows are sorted by the mutual information in the descending order.
.PP
